msgid "Ahead-of-time (AOT) caching"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide explains how to leverage OpenJDK's Ahead-of-Time (AOT) caching "
"capabilities in Quarkus to achieve significantly faster application startup "
"times."
msgstr ""

msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Starting with JDK 24, link:https://openjdk.org/projects/leyden/[Project "
"Leyden] introduces powerful AOT caching capabilities (link:https://openjdk."
"org/jeps/483[JEP 483]) that can significantly reduce Java application "
"startup time.\n"
"Quarkus provides first-class support for these features, making it easy to "
"build and deploy AOT-optimized applications."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Leyden AOT requires **JDK 24 or newer**. For older JDK versions, Quarkus can "
"fall back to AppCDS (see <<appcds-legacy>>)."
msgstr ""

